/-!
# A120254

Number of independent nonempty subsets of integers in the interval [n^2+1, (n+1)^2-1] whose product is a square. Independence is over GF(2^m).

The 60 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A120254

